---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Accessibility" description="Accessibility statement.">
  <section class="vgp-section">
    <div class="vgp-container" style="max-width:720px;">
      <h1>Accessibility</h1>
      <p>Value Growth Partners is committed to making this website usable for everyone. We aim to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 Level AA.</p>
      <p>The site is built with semantic HTML, full keyboard navigation, visible focus states, sufficient color contrast, descriptive link text, and support for reduced-motion preferences.</p>
      <h4 class="vgp-mt">Tell us if something isn't working</h4>
      <p>Accessibility is ongoing work. If you encounter a barrier or have a suggestion, please email <a href="mailto:dana@valugrowthpartners.com">dana@valugrowthpartners.com</a> and we'll respond promptly and work to resolve it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
